  triage:title "Rust merge-gate guarded_boundary_files() hardcodes only tls.toml for boundaries/atm-storage/, excluding async-mailbox-reader.toml" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-architecture/tests/boundary_enforcement.rs guarded_boundary_files() hardcodes only tls.toml for boundaries/atm-storage/ (it sweeps the other two dirs), so async-mailbox-reader.toml is excluded from the Rust-level forbidden-edges cross-check (the Python gate does cover it). Add a directory sweep. ruthless F002." ;
